<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Kiki's Love 💖</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff758c, #ff7eb3);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px 30px;
      max-width: 700px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease-in-out;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-weight: normal;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .heart {
      font-size: 3rem;
      animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.3); }
      100% { transform: scale(1); }
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">
    <h1>💖 Kiki’s Love 💖</h1>
    <h2>A Love Written From My Heart</h2>

    <div class="heart">❤️</div>

    <p>
      From the moment you entered my life, everything became brighter and more meaningful.
      You are my peace, my comfort, my happiness, and my safe place.
    </p>

    <p>
      In your presence, I feel calm. In your smile, I find warmth.
      In your love, I discover strength. You make ordinary moments magical
      and difficult days easier to carry.
    </p>

    <p>
      I choose you — not just today, but every single day.
      I choose patience, honesty, loyalty, and unconditional love.
      I choose to stand beside you, to support your dreams,
      and to walk this journey with you.
    </p>

    <p>
      My love for you is steady, deep, and true.
      Not fragile. Not temporary. Just real.
    </p>

    <div class="heart">💞</div>

    <p style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: bold;">
      I choose you. Always.
    </p>

    <footer>
      Made with love ❤️ Forever & Always
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
